sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant P as Phone (DroidCam app)
  participant DC as DroidCam Client (PC)
  participant S as Scanner (browser)
  participant C as Add Product page
  participant O as Open Food Facts
  P->>DC: Camera video over Wi-Fi (port 4747)
  DC->>DC: Publish as "DroidCam Video" webcam
  U->>C: Scan barcode
  C->>S: Open scanner
  S->>S: getUserMedia: list cameras, pick DroidCam Video (HD)
  loop About 6 times a second
    S->>S: Read green-box area, decode barcode
  end
  alt Same barcode as last time
    S-->>U: Show Use … again button
  else New barcode
    S->>C: onDetected(code)
    alt Barcode already in catalogue
      C-->>U: Open that product for updating
    else New product
      C->>C: Fill Barcode field
      C->>O: GET /api/v2/product/{code}
      O-->>C: brand, name, quantity (or not found)
      C-->>U: Item name filled, enter the rest
    end
  end
